anti-govt involvement when it comes to control of one's body but not
when it comes to mixing one's body + labor + land. That is, they will
fight as hard as libertarians against anti-abortion, anti-gay, 
anti-pornography, anti-drug laws, but they won't fight as hard 
for the right to property, to keep and bear arms, to form voluntary
contracts with people of your choice. Righties will do just the opposite
