Hey, Rand kept smoking after they took one of her lungs out. That
isn't the point of objectivism, though.

Objectivism has legitimately good points. Don't throw out the baby
with the bathwater.

Do you think that Capitalism is a bad thing?
Do you believe human relationships should be involuntary?
Do you think that you are obligated to help other people, and that if
they are needy and you have more than them you are *obligated* to help
